415	     * submitted telephone has already been normalized to E.164 by {@link #normalizeTelephone};
416	     * each stored owner's telephone is normalized the same way before comparison so differing
417	     * input formats collapse to the same value.
418	     *
419	     * @param normalizedTelephone the submitted, already-normalized E.164 telephone
420	     * @throws DuplicateTelephoneException with a 409 status if another owner already uses the
