542	    /**
543	     * Assigns the owner's {@code householdId} on create: a stable, deterministic identifier for
544	     * the household, the first 12 hex characters of the SHA-256 digest of the owner's normalized
545	     * {@code lastName} and {@code postcode} (see {@link #householdIdFor}). Because it is derived
546	     * purely from those two fields, every owner sharing a last name and postcode is assigned the
547	     * same value automatically — including one joining an existing household via
548	     * {@code sharesHousehold} — independent of create order.
549	     *
550	     * @param owner the owner being created (with its {@code lastName} and {@code postcode} already set)
